OL,3,GNEWSAForensic investigation near
OL,4,Astation after assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of road in front of Brighton
OL,7,FRailway Station has been cordoned off
OL,8,Ffor forensic investigations following a
OL,9,Fserious assault, police say.
OL,11,FSussex Police said it received a report
OL,12,Fof an incident in Queens Road at about
OL,13,F03:45 BST on Sunday.
OL,15,FA 32-year-old man had facial injuries
OL,16,Fand was taken to hospital for
OL,17,Ftreatment, the force added.
OL,19,FPolice said enquiries were ongoing to
OL,20,Ffind the suspect and urged anyone with
OL,21,Frelevant information to contact them.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
